h &gt; 0\"><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4xNM2XwAItEPJ.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-loaded=\"done\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4xNM2XwAItEPJ.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 ng-scope rtl\" ng-class=\"getDirection(th.tweet.language)\" ng-repeat=\"(k, th) in tweets\"><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\">Historically, on this day (12/16/1773) what was historically called (Boston Tea Party) took place, which is the rise of a number of English settlers who disguised themselves as Red Indians carrying axes and boarded English ships in Boston harbor and unloaded 340 From tea boxes in the sea… Continues…</div><div class=\"ccc light-opacity mb-2 ng-scope\" ng-if=\"th.tweet.media != null &amp;&amp; th.tweet.media.length &gt; 0\"><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4ycoGWQAQSIQJ.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-loaded=\"done\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4ycoGWQAQSIQJ.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4yczpWUAE9mvg.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-loaded=\"done\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4yczpWUAE9mvg.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4ydA4WQAQBGLu.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-loaded=\"done\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4ydA4WQAQBGLu.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 ng-scope rtl\" ng-class=\"getDirection(th.tweet.language)\" ng-repeat=\"(k, th) in tweets\"><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\">This act was the result of protesting against the tea tax imposed by the government in London on them, as the settlers believed that they should not be taxed without representation in the English Parliament and their revolution known as “No taxation without representation.”</div><div class=\"ccc light-opacity mb-2 ng-scope\" ng-if=\"th.tweet.media != null &amp;&amp; th.tweet.media.length &gt; 0\"><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4zkvWXoAAtGr6.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-loaded=\"done\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4zkvWXoAAtGr6.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4zk65XEAMHn_t.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-loaded=\"done\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4zk65XEAMHn_t.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4zlLOWYAQrj88.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload afkl-lazy-image-loading\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG4zlLOWYAQrj88.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 ng-scope rtl\" ng-class=\"getDirection(th.tweet.language)\" ng-repeat=\"(k, th) in tweets\"><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\">Such protests and their developments led to the independence of the states that united in the name of the United States of America... especially since Americans have become very fond of tea and every American consumes more than 300 cups a year...</div><div class=\"ccc light-opacity mb-2 ng-scope\" ng-if=\"th.tweet.media != null &amp;&amp; th.tweet.media.length &gt; 0\"><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG41EIlXoAUSUcC.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload afkl-lazy-image-loading\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG41EIlXoAUSUcC.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 ng-scope rtl\" ng-class=\"getDirection(th.tweet.language)\" ng-repeat=\"(k, th) in tweets\"><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\">The slogan became \"Dump the tea in the sea\". A cheer chanted by children at the American Independence Day celebrations, on the Fourth of July every year in Boston. This chant occurred three years after the Boston Massacre in 1773.</div><div class=\"ccc light-opacity mb-2 ng-scope\" ng-if=\"th.tweet.media != null &amp;&amp; th.tweet.media.length &gt; 0\"><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG43MmaXoAAOs4o.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload afkl-lazy-image-loading\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG43MmaXoAAOs4o.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 ng-scope rtl\" ng-class=\"getDirection(th.tweet.language)\" ng-repeat=\"(k, th) in tweets\"><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\">The throwing of tea load by revolutionaries in protest of the British taxation marked the beginning of a massive revolution for independence. Americans were so fond of tea that in 1760, they were drinking over a million pounds of tea a year. So, when the British wanted to raise taxes on the tea beloved to the Americans, they didn't give them a chance.</div><div class=\"ccc light-opacity mb-2 ng-scope\" ng-if=\"th.tweet.media != null &amp;&amp; th.tweet.media.length &gt; 0\"><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG44lviX0AAbhdr.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload afkl-lazy-image-loading\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG44lviX0AAbhdr.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 ng-scope rtl\" ng-class=\"getDirection(th.tweet.language)\" ng-repeat=\"(k, th) in tweets\"><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\">وهكذا اصبح الشاي في حفلة بوسطن للشاي أحد أول المسببات لثورة وحرب عالمية ادت لاستقلال الولايات المتحدة من بريطانيا.\nوتعد هذه أول حرب عالمية بسبب الشاي كون الشاي وقتها يعد المشروب الاهم بعد الماء..\nوتقبلو تحياتي\n<a class=\"notranslate\" href=\"https://rattibha.com/hashtag/%D9%85%D8%AA%D8%AD%D9%81_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B4%D8%A7%D9%8A\">#متحف_الشاي</a>\n<a class=\"notranslate\" href=\"https://rattibha.com/hashtag/%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B1%D8%AD%D8%A7%D9%84_%D9%88%D8%A7%D8%A6%D9%84_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AF%D8%BA%D9%81%D9%82\">#الرحال_وائل_الدغفق</a>\n<a class=\"notranslate\" href=\"https://rattibha.com/hashtag/%D8%B1%D8%AD%D8%A7%D9%84_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%A8%D8%B1\">#رحال_الخبر</a>\n<a class=\"notranslate\" href=\"https://rattibha.com/hashtag/%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%AFRK\">#رودRK</a>\n<span class=\"show-hide-mh\"><i class=\"plus-s border\">+</i></span></div><div class=\"ccc light-opacity mb-2 ng-scope\" ng-if=\"th.tweet.media != null &amp;&amp; th.tweet.media.length &gt; 0\"><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG46BLoWQAYIX4P.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload afkl-lazy-image-loading\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FG46BLoWQAYIX4P.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 pb-4 border-top pt-4\" ng-show=\"!threadUpdate &amp;&amp; !thread_loading &amp;&amp; !main_loading\">#الرحال_وائل_الدغفق </div><div class=\"mb-4 pb-4 border-top pt-4\" ng-show=\"!threadUpdate &amp;&amp; !thread_loading &amp;&amp; !main_loading\">#رحال_الخبر </div><div class=\"mb-4 pb-4 border-top pt-4\" ng-show=\"!threadUpdate &amp;&amp; !thread_loading &amp;&amp; !main_loading\">#رودRK </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto entries col-md-12 col-lg-8\" ng-show=\"!view_loading &amp;&amp; !loadmore &amp;&amp; !main_loading &amp;&amp; show_sidebar\"><div class=\"sidebar-box rtl blog-entries\"><div class=\"ng-scope\" ng-if=\"most_requested_week.length &gt; 0\"><div class=\"row welcome mb-2\"><div class=\"post-entry-horzontal mb-3 ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"(k, th) in most_requested_week  | limitTo:4\"><span class=\"text\"><a class=\"feed blog-entry p-1 rtl\" href=\"https://rattibha.com/thread/1470834913691713540\" ng-class=\"getDirection(th.thread.t.language)\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><div class=\"post-meta d-flex\"><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"notranslate ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"parse_emoji_img(th.thread.u.name)\"><img alt=\"🇸🇦\" class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://twemoji.maxcdn.com/v/12.1.2/72x72/1f1f8-1f1e6.png\"/></span><span class=\"sub notranslate ng-binding ltr-noside\" ng-bind=\"toDate(th.thread.t.added, th.thread.t.language)\" ng-class=\"getDirection(th.thread.t.language) == 'rtl' ? 'ltr-noside' : ''\" title=\"2021-12-14 19:15:44\">١٤ ديسمبر ٢٠٢١</span></div></div></div></a></span></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>",
  "content_text": "Boston_Tea_Party\n#الرحال_وائل_الدغفق #رودRK\n@aldaqfaq\nHave you heard about\n#حفلة_شاي_بوسطن\nthat led to the independence of the United States of America called\n#Boston_Tea_Party\nHere is a picture of Boston Harbor, from which the spark of the revolution started.\n#متحف_الشاي\n#الرحال_وائل_الدغفق\n#رحال_الخبر\n#رودRK\nHistorically, on this day (12/16/1773) what was historically called (Boston Tea Party) took place, which is the rise of a number of English settlers who disguised themselves as Red Indians carrying axes and boarded English ships in Boston harbor and unloaded 340 From tea boxes in the sea… Continues…\nThis act was the result of protesting against the tea tax imposed by the government in London on them, as the settlers believed that they should not be taxed without representation in the English Parliament and their revolution known as “No taxation without representation.”\nSuch protests and their developments led to the independence of the states that united in the name of the United States of America... especially since Americans have become very fond of tea and every American consumes more than 300 cups a year...\nThe slogan became \"Dump the tea in the sea\". A cheer chanted by children at the American Independence Day celebrations, on the Fourth of July every year in Boston. This chant occurred three years after the Boston Massacre in 1773.\nThe throwing of tea load by revolutionaries in protest of the British taxation marked the beginning of a massive revolution for independence. Americans were so fond of tea that in 1760, they were drinking over a million pounds of tea a year. So, when the British wanted to raise taxes on the tea beloved to the Americans, they didn't give them a chance.\nوهكذا اصبح الشاي في حفلة بوسطن للشاي أحد أول المسببات لثورة وحرب عالمية ادت لاستقلال الولايات المتحدة من بريطانيا.\nوتعد هذه أول حرب عالمية بسبب الشاي كون الشاي وقتها يعد المشروب الاهم بعد الماء..\nوتقبلو تحياتي\n#متحف_الشاي\n#الرحال_وائل_الدغفق\n#رحال_الخبر\n#رودRK\n+\n#الرحال_وائل_الدغفق\n#رحال_الخبر\n#رودRK\n١٤ ديسمبر ٢٠٢١",
